        "es": "Potencia su Ataque Especial si un Pokémon aliado tiene la habilidad Más o Menos.",
        "en": "This Pokémon has 1.5× its Special Attack if any friendly Pokémon has Plus or Minus.\n\nThis bonus does not count as a stat modifier.  If either ability is disabled by Gastro Acid, both lose their effect."
      }
